    "guidance": [
      "Secondary skills receive no education bonus. I.Q. applies once; special power-category bonuses remain pending.",
      "Technical: any; Pilot Basic: any; Science: Astronomy and Mathematics only. Biology is excluded; Medical permits First Aid or Holistic Medicine, so Paramedic is excluded. These eligibility rules cover only the currently defined eight skills.",
      "Secondary proficiency does not imply professional or commercial quality. A shared program grant retains its program quality; a skill solely selected as Secondary is competent, non-professional.",
      "Other Secondary categories and special selection costs, including Holistic Medicine and hand-to-hand training, remain unfinished. Street skill choices and literacy trades remain separate pending work."
    ]
